# --- Large, regenerable data (NOT released; see README to rebuild) ---
data/beir/          # raw BEIR corpora (download via scripts/01_download_beir.py)
data/indexes/       # BM25 indexes (rebuild via scripts/02_build_bm25_index.py)
data/retrieval/     # BM25 top-100 hits (rebuild via scripts/03_bm25_retrieve.py)
data/trecdl/*.gz    # raw TREC DL top-1000 pools (re-download)
data/trecdl/*.txt   # raw TREC DL qrels (re-download)

# --- Released artifacts ARE tracked (whitelisted; see README) ---
#   data/scores/**/*.parquet         scored query-document pairs (logits + labels)
#   data/calibration/*.csv, *.json   metrics + fitted calibrators
#   data/trecdl/*.parquet            built TREC DL scoring inputs
#   data/figures/*.png               paper figures

